msgstr "Meditation! Tystnad? ... Ta en titt ..."

#: level_i18n.cc:4572
msgid "These stormy days ..."
msgstr "Dessa stormiga dagar ..."

#: level_i18n.cc:4577
msgid "Only A Labyrinth"
msgstr "Bara en labyrint"

#: level_i18n.cc:4585
msgid "Survival Training in wasted Landscapes ..."
msgstr "Överlevnadsträning i ödelagda landskap ..."

#: level_i18n.cc:4590
